{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12202440","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12202440","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1220244001:0":{"text":"用力！用力掰下来，哈哈！","source_cn":"用力！用力掰下来，哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38293D059EB2B9C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220244002:0":{"text":"哈，这根钢管不错，不像前头那几根破烂，全锈坏了！","source_cn":"哈，这根钢管不错，不像前头那几根破烂，全锈坏了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C29E89F51FC3810","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220244003:0":{"text":"混蛋，又来偷水管了？！","source_cn":"混蛋，又来偷水管了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49E214A1EC9FB4D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220244004:1":{"text":"就是你们害我的店老是断水？信不信老子送你们去喂鲨鱼！","source_cn":"就是你们害我的店老是断水？信不信老子送你们去喂鲨鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CE91ACCD113D562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220244005:1":{"text":"不就是断水吗？反正水又不好喝，根本没人喝水！","source_cn":"不就是断水吗？反正水又不好喝，根本没人喝水！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5281C9B9040315A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220244006:1":{"text":"反、反、反正喝酒，喝酒就行了！水……又贵，又，嗝，难喝！","source_cn":"反、反、反正喝酒，喝酒就行了！水……又贵，又，嗝，难喝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17104B3091D76F43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220244007:1":{"text":"你这管子早就烂了，丢路边都没人要……我们拿去玩玩怎么了？","source_cn":"你这管子早就烂了，丢路边都没人要……我们拿去玩玩怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AB5DEA3FD9C8080","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220244008:1":{"text":"胡言乱语的混蛋，脑子都被酒泡坏了吧，你们知道在和谁说话吗？","source_cn":"胡言乱语的混蛋，脑子都被酒泡坏了吧，你们知道在和谁说话吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCD4D1C75BFF1BFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220244009:1":{"text":"这些家伙身上一股酒气，又在大白天喝酒了吧……","source_cn":"这些家伙身上一股酒气，又在大白天喝酒了吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC288A1688F62473C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220244010:1":{"text":"啊，我记得你们几个！怪模怪样的家伙和仓鼠！","source_cn":"啊，我记得你们几个！怪模怪样的家伙和仓鼠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CA3DA7AC57269F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220244011:1":{"text":"上回看在沃尔特的面子上饶你们一回，怎么这次又带了个矮子来？","source_cn":"上回看在沃尔特的面子上饶你们一回，怎么这次又带了个矮子来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4BC29B6D78FAC50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220244012:1":{"text":"矮子？！你说谁矮子呢？！没礼貌的家伙，需要吃点苦头！","source_cn":"矮子？！你说谁矮子呢？！没礼貌的家伙，需要吃点苦头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E2BFCBA3519D697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220244013:1":{"text":"哼，正好试试新到手的家伙好不好使！","source_cn":"哼，正好试试新到手的家伙好不好使！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65A172F59CF82B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:喝醉的混混":{"text":"喝醉的混混","source":"喝醉的混混","status":"source"},"speaker:暴躁的混混":{"text":"暴躁的混混","source":"暴躁的混混","status":"source"},"speaker:波尔斯":{"text":"波尔斯","source":"波尔斯","status":"source"},"speaker:粗鲁的混混":{"text":"粗鲁的混混","source":"粗鲁的混混","status":"source"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"漫漫","source":"漫漫","status":"source"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"呼金","source":"呼金","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":6}}